  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "I woke up in the body of “Mob 1”, who married the villain and died in a violent manner in the book, so now I just really must not get married to him then! So I proposed to another man, try to run away from home, and try all sorts of other methods. \n\n*“So marry me, Evangeline Clauda.”* \n\nIt has been five years of life in the book, it's three weeks before entering the original story line I know! Despite everything I tried, he still proposed to me. Am I… Am I doomed to a horrible ending? \n\nThe more I twist the original storyline, the closer I get to it?! Will I be able to safely protect my life and love and find happiness?\n\n(Source: Kakao, translated)\n\n*Note: This is a promotional one-shot for the homonym novel.*",
